---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="Peptide Rulebook is an informational reference only. It is not legal advice, medical advice, or a substitute for a qualified professional." canonical="/disclaimer">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Disclaimer', href: '/disclaimer' }]} />
    <div class="py-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-muted">Peptide Rulebook is an independent informational reference. Nothing on this site is legal advice, medical advice, or a substitute for consulting a qualified professional and the official controlling source.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Medical disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">The information on this site is not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment guidance. It does not establish a clinician–patient relationship. Do not start, stop, or change any medication, supplement, or treatment based solely on information here. Always consult a licensed healthcare professional for personal medical decisions.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Legal and regulatory disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">The content on this site is not legal, compliance, or regulatory advice for any specific product, business, prescription, or jurisdiction. Regulatory status can change, and official sources may interpret or enforce rules differently than summarized here. Always verify the current official source — such as FDA, WADA, DEA, or the relevant state board — before making compliance, prescribing, purchasing, or business decisions.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Accuracy and currency</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">We aim for accuracy and link to controlling sources, but laws, guidances, and enforcement priorities change. Every page shows a last-verified date and next-review date, but those dates do not guarantee completeness. If you find an error or outdated entry, please <a href="/contact" class="text-accent hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">Peptide Rulebook, its authors, and reviewers are not liable for any loss, claim, or decision made based on information on this site. Use of the site is at your own risk.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-ink">No affiliation</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">This site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, WADA, DEA, or any other regulatory body.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
